# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide shows how to use the [SBD eigensolver](https://github.com/Qiskit/sbd-eigensolver-python) as an alternative selected configuration interaction (SCI) solver to diagonalize larger fermionic problems beyond what the default PySCF solver can support. SBD (Selected Basis Diagonalization) runs in-process, is parallelized with MPI, and offers both CPU and CUDA backends. For information on how to install and use it, see the [SBD documentation](https://github.com/Qiskit/sbd-eigensolver-python).\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng gabay na ito kung paano gamitin ang [SBD eigensolver](https://github.com/Qiskit/sbd-eigensolver-python) bilang alternatibong selected configuration interaction (SCI) solver para i-diagonalize ang mas malalaking fermionic na problema na lampas sa kayang suportahan ng default na PySCF solver. Ang SBD (Selected Basis Diagonalization) ay tumatakbo in-process, naka-parallelize gamit ang MPI, at nag-aalok ng parehong CPU at CUDA backend. Para sa impormasyon kung paano ito i-install at gamitin, tingnan ang [dokumentasyon ng SBD](https://github.com/Qiskit/sbd-eigensolver-python).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SBD compiles a C++ extension against the MPI and BLAS libraries available on the machine, so you must install both before you install the `sbd` extra:\n"
msgstr "Kino-compile ng SBD ang isang C++ extension laban sa mga MPI at BLAS library na available sa makina, kaya dapat mong i-install ang dalawa bago i-install ang extra na `sbd`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because `solve_sci_batch` already matches the solver interface that `diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian` expects, you can pass it directly to `sci_solver` after you bind its configuration options with `functools.partial`. To run on a CUDA-capable GPU instead of the CPU, pass `device_config=DeviceConfig.gpu()` from `sbd.device_config`.\n"
msgstr "Dahil tugma na ang `solve_sci_batch` sa solver interface na inaasahan ng `diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian`, maaari mo itong direktang ipasa sa `sci_solver` pagkatapos mong i-bind ang mga opsyon sa configuration nito gamit ang `functools.partial`. Para tumakbo sa CUDA-capable na GPU sa halip na sa CPU, ipasa ang `device_config=DeviceConfig.gpu()` mula sa `sbd.device_config`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more details on the SQD code used in this example, see the [chemistry Hamiltonian tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization).\n"
msgstr "Para sa karagdagang detalye tungkol sa SQD code na ginamit sa halimbawang ito, tingnan ang [tutorial ng chemistry Hamiltonian](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization).\n"
